# Hypothesis-recovery benchmark — revision results (Comment #7)

**Nature Methods rebuttal policy:** all dual-arm runs use the **full** AnnData
listed in each fixture `dataset_manifest.json`. **No cell/spot subsampling.**

Automatic scores: `demo/score_hypothesis_recovery.py` (heuristic v1).
**Expert audit required before quoting numbers in the manuscript.**

## Protocol

Identical inputs per fixture: full `.h5ad` + withheld `background.md`
(no gold claims / PDF findings).

| Arm | Runner |
|-----|--------|
| TissueAgent | Live 3-phase (`--live`): explore → draft → test/narrow |
| CellVoyager | `run_cellvoyager_analysis`, `gpt-4o`, `num_analyses=1`, ≥2 repeats |

